@startuml Schedules
title Schedule Management

actor User
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "API Backend" as API
participant "Database" as DB

== Viewing Schedules ==
User -> App: Open schedules
App -> API: GET /api/schedules/{garden_id}/
API -> DB: Fetch schedules
DB -> API: Return schedule list
API -> App: Schedule data
App -> User: Display schedules with timing and actions

== Creating New Schedule ==
User -> App: Set cron expression and action
App -> API: POST /api/schedules/{garden_id}/\n{cron, action}
API -> DB: Create scheduled task
DB -> API: Task created
API -> App: Return task_id
App -> User: Add schedule to list

== Creating Weekly Schedule ==
User -> App: Select days and time
App -> API: POST /api/schedules/weekly/{garden_id}/
API -> DB: Create weekly schedule
DB -> API: Task created
API -> App: Return task_id
App -> User: Display weekly schedule

== Updating Schedule ==
User -> App: Change cron expression
App -> API: PUT /api/schedules/{task_id}/\n{cron}
API -> DB: Update schedule timing
DB -> API: Updated
API -> App: Success
App -> User: Refresh schedule display

== Toggling Schedule ==
User -> App: Tap toggle switch
App -> API: POST /api/schedules/{task_id}/toggle/
API -> DB: Toggle schedule state
DB -> API: Updated
API -> App: Success
App -> User: Update toggle UI

== Deleting Schedule ==
User -> App: Confirm deletion
App -> API: DELETE /api/schedules/{task_id}/
API -> DB: Remove schedule permanently
DB -> API: Deleted
API -> App: Success
App -> User: Remove from list

@enduml
